----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    Filename:       signal.dac.audio.spin2
    Description:    DAC: Audio output
        * mono, stereo, 8-bit, 16-bit
    Author:         Jesse Burt
    Started:        Mar 16, 2020
    Updated:        Oct 27, 2024
